# UI and UX

- Thai-first labels. Shared tokens/components across all eight menus. Apply a restrained, system-wide Neumorphism visual language through theme-aware surface/shadow tokens: use raised/inset surfaces and soft shadows only where they clarify hierarchy; avoid shadowing every nested element or reducing data density/readability. Keep existing light/dark/special-dark modes; Neumorphism is not a separate theme toggle.
- Shadows and surface colors never replace readable labels, semantic status colors, selected/error states, contrast, or a visible keyboard focus ring. Preserve clear boundaries and explicit states where soft surfaces alone are ambiguous. Contrast via button/badge/dialog tokens — do not force `text-foreground` on every `button`/`span`/`div`.
- Breakpoints: phone <640, tablet 640–1023, notebook ≥1024 (`sm` / `lg`). No page-level horizontal overflow. Local scroll only (Board columns, tabs).
- Shell: `html, body { overflow: hidden }`; `h-svh`. Main uses `PAGE_MAIN` from `components/layout/page-layout.ts` except Board (inner pane scroll, no double-scroll on `main`).
- Reuse `PAGE_INNER`, `PAGE_TOOLBAR`, `PAGE_HEADING`, `STAT_GRID`, `FILTER_ROW`, `ACTION_LABEL_CLASS`, `TAB_SCROLL_CLASS`, `TAB_TRIGGER_CLASS`.
- Dialogs: `components/ui/responsive-dialog.ts` (`DIALOG_SHELL_WIDE_CLASS` / `DIALOG_SHELL_SCROLL_CLASS`). Opaque `bg-card`. Confirm-delete stays an alert dialog.
- Charts: `min-width: 0` in flex/grid. Axes, legend, tooltip, and labels stay inside the chart frame on every breakpoint.
- Motion: existing CSS/utilities only. Hover/focus 120–180 ms. Dialog/dropdown 160–220 ms. Keyboard focus + `prefers-reduced-motion`. Motion must not delay saves or shift layout.
- Every surface needs loading, empty, validation, 404, permission denied, and server-error states. Never replace API errors with zeros or mock numbers.
- Theme: `ThemeProvider` `storageKey="project-management-theme"`. Light / dark / special-dark share the same solid-button contrast.
- Success export buttons use white text. Field panels on `bg-muted/40` use `text-foreground`.
